{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple love story set in a modern city, featuring me and three girls. It offers players a light-hearted escape from their busy work lives. The story takes place in the company where I work as a supervisor. Together with the three women, I experience various moments\u2014joys of success, frustrations of failure, hidden affections, and emotional misunderstandings. The game follows a linear narrative, with hundreds of video clips providing branching choices for the players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xu Zhaozhao</strong> \u2013 Pure, adorable, and radiating sweet energy\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947480/extras/1f8fbf7adae24fc2bd438a015e1f6a74.poster.avif?t=1761637656\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947480/extras/1f8fbf7adae24fc2bd438a015e1f6a74.webm?t=1761637656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947480/extras/1f8fbf7adae24fc2bd438a015e1f6a74.mp4?t=1761637656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet her heart seems to hide a secret tied to you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947480/extras/81d1804fd035bc76240ab86db9beba61.poster.avif?t=1761637656\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947480/extras/81d1804fd035bc76240ab86db9beba61.webm?t=1761637656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.ak